{"id": "68417", "title": "首席，别太腹黑", "author": "妃陌", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 35, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68417.htm", "intro": "一夜之间，林汐这个名字成了K市最大的笑柄，市长千金又怎么样，音乐天才又怎么样，再美丽也不过是一个在新婚当晚就出轨的贱女人罢了。 \r\n爸爸为了在选举中连任市长，狠心将她赶出家门；好友为了讨好林家真正的宝贝千金，漠然的与她断绝来往。\r\n从天之骄女，到一无所有，从众星拱月，到众叛亲离，林汐尝尽了世态炎凉。没有人知道，这个不要脸的背叛者，其实才是遭受背叛的人。\r\n从天堂坠入地狱的滋味，让她学会了报复，所谓命运，不过是适者生存，既然幸福这般奢侈，那么伤害她的人，又怎么配得到呢？", "base": "files/article/html/68/68417", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "10528243.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10528244.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "10528245.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "10528246.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "10528247.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "10528248.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "10528249.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "10528250.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "10528251.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "10528252.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11", "file": "10528253.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12", "file": "10528254.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13", "file": "10528255.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14", "file": "10528256.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15", "file": "10528257.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16", "file": "10528258.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17", "file": "10528259.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18", "file": "10528260.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19", "file": "10528261.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20", "file": "10528262.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21", "file": "10528263.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22", "file": "10528264.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23", "file": "10528265.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24", "file": "10528266.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25", "file": "10528267.html